  "body": [
    "Experience a living, breathing library designed for the way creative work actually happens.",
    "Drag, drop and forget about it. Playbook handles heavy lifting in the background, generating stunning, high-resolution previews instantly. Whether it's a 2GB RAW file or quick PNG, you finally see the beauty of your work the moment it touches your workspace. In Playbook, you can also add HEX codes, live URLs, and notes right alongside your assets.",
    "Group similar formats, iterations, or files type into elegant \"stacks.\" One thumbnail on the outside, your entire process stays intact on the inside. It's organization that keeps your gallery present-ready at any moment, especially when it's last-minute. Playbook's visual intelligent automatically detects duplicates and automatically merge or group them.",
    "Your work isn't one-size-fits-all, so your view shouldn't be either. In Playbook, you can switch between stunning Gallery for browsing, List for displaying more details, or Kanban to keep track of your projects.",
    "Need to copy 500 assets to a new board, update their tags and change their permissions? Do it all at once. Our batch action tools are built for scale, allowing your to manage your entire libraries with the same effort it takes to manage a single file."
  ],
